[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583007238","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112329#issuecomment-3583007238","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112329","id":3583007238,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VkFoG","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T19:56:05Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T19:56:05Z","body":"CC @van800 - there aren't too many contributors active around the DAP aside from @rsubtil and you, so it would be great if you could review/test that it's helpful for Rider.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583007238/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3586278171","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112329#issuecomment-3586278171","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112329","id":3586278171,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VwkMb","user":{"login":"van800","id":1482681,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODI2ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1482681?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800","html_url":"https://github.com/van800","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/van800/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T14:49:44Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T14:49:44Z","body":"Thank you for calling me in this PR. Very nice improvement indeed. \r\n\r\nIt doesn't brake any existing functionallity in Rider, however it seems IJ platfrom (used in Rider) doesn't have means for commanding individual threads anyway (or I haven't yet found). It might be useful to support breaking all threads at once with existing \"pause\" command, which currently doesn't do anything at all. It would be useful for seeing what the game is doing. However it is clearly out of scope of this PR.\r\n\r\nAlso `on_debug_breaked` and `p_reallydid` sound confusing, but were not introduced in this PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3586278171/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587119647","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112329#issuecomment-3587119647","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112329","id":3587119647,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Vzxof","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T19:39:14Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T19:39:38Z","body":"> It might be useful to support breaking all threads at once with existing \"pause\" command, which currently doesn't do anything at all. It would be useful for seeing what the game is doing. However it is clearly out of scope of this PR.\r\n\r\nYeah, that's one of the few issues coming from Godot that I mentioned; it currently doesn't support pausing all threads, only the main thread. So for this, it needs to first be implemented in Godot before DAP can offer it.\r\n\r\n> Also `on_debug_breaked` and `p_reallydid` sound confusing, but were not introduced in this PR.\r\n\r\nYep, that's from Godot's internal debugging protocol. The debugging flow is a bit weird in some aspects, and I have a couple of ideas to improve it too. But that's definitely for other PRs :wink: ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587119647/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]